 "_comment": "1.48 Friends Board (src/systems/Pairs.ts, server section \"1.48 friends board\" in supabase/schema.sql). Two friends who both say yes share a board: every week (Monday 00:00 UTC) it gets `tasks` deliveries picked from `templates` for the lower of their two levels (the newest 60 levels of templates when there are enough). Both must give to every task: one friend can give at most 3/4 of it (`share` is the least the other gives). A finished task pays both of them XP (`xpTask` of the XP to their next level), coins (`coinsTask` x the goods sell value) and moves their bond on; a full board pays `xpFull` more and `tokensFull` Friendship Tokens. Every `bondTasks` tasks done together is a bond level (up to `bondMax`): `bondXp` more XP each. Goods given to a task that is not finished by the end of the week, or when a friend leaves, come back to whoever gave them. A player has at most `partners` boards (with invites they sent). The server keeps its own copy of level, partners, tasks, maxGive, givesPerDay and templates in pair_catalog(): validate-data checks they match. game_config `pairs` false switches it off.",
